sequenceDiagram
    actor Analyst
    participant API as FastAPI query API
    participant Pipeline
    participant Gate as Policy gate
    participant DB as PostgreSQL read-only role
    participant Steward
    participant Approvals API
    Analyst->>API: Submit question
    API->>Pipeline: Retrieve, generate SQL, validate
    Pipeline->>Gate: Estimate cost and inspect sensitivity/joins
    Gate->>DB: EXPLAIN query
    Gate-->>Pipeline: Approval reason
    Pipeline-->>API: PENDING_APPROVAL
    API-->>Analyst: Query status and SQL
    Steward->>Approvals API: Approve/reject with reason
    Approvals API->>Approvals API: Check role, expiry, no self-approval
    alt approved
        Approvals API->>Pipeline: Revalidate approved SQL
        Pipeline->>DB: Execute with read-only role
        DB-->>Pipeline: Rows
        Pipeline-->>Analyst: Result and audit status
    else rejected
        Approvals API-->>Analyst: Rejected status
    end
